<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="S7.T4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Baseline performance on verdict prediction and justification generation with ground-truth evidence (first block) and without accessing any external evidence (second block).</span>
