<div id="A4.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Metadata about Claims. </span>We present the distribution of claim types and fact-checking strategies in Table <a href="#A4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ D.3 Metadata Distributions ‣ Appendix D Additional Dataset Information ‣ AVerImaTeC: A Dataset for Automatic Verification of Image-Text Claims with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ D.3 Metadata Distributions ‣ Appendix D Additional Dataset Information ‣ AVerImaTeC: A Dataset for Automatic Verification of Image-Text Claims with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, respectively. It is important to note that a single claim may belong to multiple claim types and can be verified using several fact-checking strategies.</p>
</div>
