<figure id="A4.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span><span id="A4.T9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Distributions of metadata related to answers.</span> The first block is the distribution for answering methods, the second for answer types and the third for source medium.</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T9.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
