<div id="A7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Due to the limitation of space, we provide the zero-shot performance of baselines in Table <a href="#A7.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ G.1 Zero-shot Performance of Baselines ‣ Appendix G Additional Experimental Results ‣ AVerImaTeC: A Dataset for Automatic Verification of Image-Text Claims with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. The findings discussed in Section <a href="#S7.SS2" title="7.2 Main Results ‣ 7 Experiments ‣ AVerImaTeC: A Dataset for Automatic Verification of Image-Text Claims with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7.2</span></a> hold for baselines under the zero-shot setting as well.</p>
</div>
